  "script": "scratchpad accept.py (kept outside the repository: C:/Users/Thomas/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/c9297f7a0d106409/07b978c7-5e17-4c62-8163-b07dfd2048d2/scratchpad/accept.py); run with .venv-audio/Scripts/python.exe accept.py <repo> accept.json. Per-file numbers are under per_file below.",
  "rule": "new == old sample for sample where old |x| < 1; where old |x| >= 1 (sat at full scale) new has the same sign and |new| >= 1.",
  "tolerance_needed": "none: max abs difference where old |x| < 1 is 0.0 in all 72 files (bit-identical, float32). Both sets come from the same fp16 decode on the same card and the clamp is the only difference. A tolerance was not needed; the check counted differences above 1e-3 and 1e-2: 0 in every file.",
  "result": "PASS for 72 of 72. Files with at least one sample at full scale in the old file: 50 (1921 samples in total); in all of them sign equal and |new| >= 1 for every one of those samples (violations: 0). The other 22 files have no sample at |x| >= 1 and are identical to the old ones.",
